{
 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "Yismake Worku is one of the most prominent, bestselling contemporary Ethiopian novelists. He is widely celebrated for redefining modern Amharic literature through high-speed sci-fi thrillers, political satire, and techno-utopian themes. His breakout novel, Dertogada, published in 2009, became a massive cultural phenomenon in Ethiopia. Major Works and Series The Dertogada Universe: His most famous techno-thriller"
 },
